                                   "snippet":  "[Letterboxd Review of \"Tokyo Sonata\"] Kurosawa translates his expertise in horror to the family drama, revealing that there truly isn\u0027t anything scarier than success being defined by domestic rituals we can no longer afford to maintain financially or emotionally.",
