                                   "title":  "Tokyo Sonata - Wikipedia",
                                   "snippet":  "Tokyo Sonata (Japanese: トウキョウソナタ) is a 2008 Japanese psychological drama film directed and co-written by Kiyoshi Kurosawa. It stars Teruyuki Kagawa, Kyōko Koizumi, Yū Koyanagi and Kai Inowaki as an emotionally distant middle-class family of four who all individually come to question their life choices and futures.",
                                   "link":  "en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Sonata"
                               },
                               {
                                   "title":  "Tokyo Sonata (2008) - IMDb",
                                   "snippet":  "Tokyo Sonata: Directed by Kiyoshi Kurosawa. With Teruyuki Kagawa, Kyôko Koizumi, Yû Koyanagi, Kai Inowaki. An ordinary Japanese family slowly disintegrates after its patriarch loses his job at a prominent company.",
                                   "link":  "www.imdb.com/title/tt0938341"
